WEBVTT

00:03:29.964 --> 00:03:32.839
Are you there for me?

00:03:32.863 --> 00:03:36.587
Especially, are you emotionally
present and available for me?

00:03:36.611 --> 00:03:38.917
Friends are there for each other.

00:03:39.231 --> 00:03:40.403
One.

00:03:40.427 --> 00:03:45.623
The second characteristic
is that they prioritize sex.

00:03:45.647 --> 00:03:49.577
They decide that it matters
for their relationship.

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:54.098
They choose to set aside all the other
things that they could be doing --

00:03:54.122 --> 00:03:57.969
the children they could be raising
and the jobs they could be going to,

00:03:57.993 --> 00:04:00.152
the other family members
to pay attention to,